---
layout: null
---
{%- comment -%}
Consumer: the WalletScrutiny Android app
(https://gitlab.com/walletscrutiny/walletscrutinyandroid). Today the app bakes
the same list into its release from a checkout of this repository
(scripts/updateAndroidWallets.mjs over there); this file is what it fetches at
runtime instead, so badges, titles and verdict changes follow the site without
an app release. Everything in api/ is read by software outside the site; bump
schemaVersion and tell the consumer's owner before changing a field.

One entry per wallet the app tracks: the Android store entry has verdict
sourceavailable and meta ok, deprecated or absent (the same filter the app's
script applies). Fields per wallet:
  appId             Android package name
  title             altTitle (android block, then page) or title
  icon              filename under /images/wIcons/android/, or null
  users             Play Store install count as a number, or null
  verdict, meta     the Android entry's values; meta is null when absent
  alternativeStores list from the Android entry, [] when absent (fdroid, zapstore, ...)
  bitcoinOrgId      the page's top-level field, or null; non-null means
                    "Featured on Bitcoin.org", the same key the site badge uses
  repository        the Android entry's source repository, or null
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign okMetas = "ok,deprecated" | split: "," -%}
{%- assign out = "" -%}
{%- for post in site.mobile -%}
{%- assign store = post.android -%}
{%- if store.appId and store.verdict == "sourceavailable" -%}
{%- if store.meta == nil or okMetas contains store.meta -%}
{%- assign title = store.altTitle | default: post.altTitle | default: post.title | default: store.appId -%}
{%- capture entry -%}
{"appId":{{ store.appId | jsonify }}
,"title":{{ title | jsonify }}
,"icon":{{ store.icon | jsonify }}
,"users":{% if store.users %}{{ store.users | plus: 0 }}{% else %}null{% endif %}
,"verdict":{{ store.verdict | jsonify }}
,"meta":{{ store.meta | jsonify }}
,"alternativeStores":{% if store.alternativeStores %}{{ store.alternativeStores | jsonify }}{% else %}[]{% endif %}
,"bitcoinOrgId":{{ post.bitcoinOrgId | jsonify }}
,"repository":{{ store.repository | jsonify }}}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign out = out | append: "," | append: entry -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{"schemaVersion":1,"wallets":[{{ out | remove_first: "," }}]}
